  "findings": [
    {
      "severity": "FAIL",
      "title": "View-only group permission authorizes group creation and movement",
      "description": "`canManage()` accepts either `VIEW` or `MANAGE`. Consequently, an administrator granted only `view` on all groups passes the inherited `requireManage()` check used by `GroupsResource.addTopLevelGroup()`. That endpoint allows creating groups and moving an existing group to the top level.\n\nRequire `MANAGE` here, consistent with `canManage(GroupModel)`. Add a negative integration test proving that an all-groups `VIEW` grant permits reading but rejects creation and movement.",
      "file_ref": null,
      "category": "security-hygiene",
      "raw_category": null,
      "location": "services/src/main/java/org/keycloak/services/resources/admin/permissions/GroupPermissionsV2.java:70"
    },
    {
      "severity": "FAIL",
      "title": "Group-member lookup returns authorization resource IDs instead of group IDs",
      "description": "`groupResource.getId()` identifies an authorization resource, not a realm group. `AdminPermissionsSchema.getOrCreateResource()` creates authorization resources with generated IDs and stores the corresponding group ID in the resource **name**. Passing the authorization ID to `hasPermission()` also causes its `findByName()` lookup to miss the intended resource.\n\nAdditionally, individual resources created by that schema method have no `Groups` type assigned, so this type-based enumeration does not discover them; the synthetic all-groups resource does have that type, but its ID is not a group ID either.\n\nThis breaks group-scoped user counts: `UsersResource.getUsersCount()` passes this set to the user provider, whose membership queries compare it directly against actual group IDs. Authorized members can therefore appear in user searches while their count is zero.\n\nEnumerate the applicable realm groups, evaluate the intended authorization resources, and return actual group IDs. Cover individual-group and all-groups member grants with count-versus-search assertions.",
      "file_ref": null,
      "category": "correctness",
      "raw_category": null,
      "location": "services/src/main/java/org/keycloak/services/resources/admin/permissions/GroupPermissionsV2.java:121-124"
    }
  ],
